            "html": "<div class=\"detail-table-wrap\"><table class=\"detail-table\"><thead><tr><th>Attribute</th><th>Core Point (from Crossway sources)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Holiness</td><td>Transcendent otherness + moral purity; crown of all attributes (Charnock)</td></tr><tr><td>Isaiah 6</td><td>Holiness → conviction → atonement → commission: the gospel in miniature</td></tr><tr><td>Omniscience</td><td>God knows all things in an eternal instant; His foreknowledge rests on His foreordination (Jones)</td></tr><tr><td>Omnipotence</td><td>Infinite power united with sovereign dominion and perfect goodness (Charnock/Jones)</td></tr><tr><td>Omnipresence</td><td>God fills all things <em>repletively</em> — fully present everywhere, contained nowhere (Charnock)</td></tr><tr><td>Immutability</td><td>God does not change; anchor of every covenant promise (Charnock/DeYoung)</td></tr><tr><td>Eternality</td><td>God exists above and outside time; He governs history, He does not react to it (Charnock)</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
            "plainText": "| Attribute | Core Point (from Crossway sources) |\n|-----------|----------------------------------|\n| Holiness | Transcendent otherness + moral purity; crown of all attributes (Charnock) |\n| Isaiah 6 | Holiness → conviction → atonement → commission: the gospel in miniature |\n| Omniscience | God knows all things in an eternal instant; His foreknowledge rests on His foreordination (Jones) |\n| Omnipotence | Infinite power united with sovereign dominion and perfect goodness (Charnock/Jones) |\n| Omnipresence | God fills all things repletively — fully present everywhere, contained nowhere (Charnock) |\n| Immutability | God does not change; anchor of every covenant promise (Charnock/DeYoung) |\n| Eternality | God exists above and outside time; He governs history, He does not react to it (Charnock) |"
