            "plainText": "| Concept | Core Point (from Crossway sources) |\n|---------|----------------------------------|\n| Chief end of man | To glorify God and enjoy Him — these are the same end, not two (Jones/DeYoung) |\n| Glory and flourishing | Directing us toward God's glory is directing us toward our deepest good (Hames & Reeves) |\n| Soli Deo Gloria | All of life is worship when lived consciously under the Majestic God who rules all things (Jones) |\n| Idolatry | Misdirected worship; overcome not by effort but by a greater vision of God's glory (Jones) |\n| Evangelism | Seeing God's glory produces the overflow that drives mission (Hames & Reeves) |\n| Foundation | Every attribute of God studied in this course is most clearly seen in Christ (Jones) |"
