            "html": "<div class=\"detail-table-wrap\"><table class=\"detail-table\"><thead><tr><th>Doctrine</th><th>Core Point</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Spirit&#x27;s personhood</td><td>He speaks, grieves, teaches, intercedes — a genuine divine person, not a force</td></tr><tr><td>Spirit in history</td><td>Active from creation through Israel, Christ, and Pentecost — a continuous redemptive presence</td></tr><tr><td>Regeneration</td><td>New birth is the Spirit&#x27;s sovereign work — the beginning of every Christian&#x27;s life</td></tr><tr><td>Union with Christ</td><td>The Spirit is the bond that unites believers to Christ — the root of all other blessings</td></tr><tr><td>Spirit baptism</td><td>One-time, at conversion, for all believers — 1 Cor. 12:13</td></tr><tr><td>Spirit filling</td><td>Ongoing, repeatable, commanded — actively sought through obedience and prayer</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
            "plainText": "| Doctrine | Core Point |\n|----------|-----------|\n| Spirit's personhood | He speaks, grieves, teaches, intercedes — a genuine divine person, not a force |\n| Spirit in history | Active from creation through Israel, Christ, and Pentecost — a continuous redemptive presence |\n| Regeneration | New birth is the Spirit's sovereign work — the beginning of every Christian's life |\n| Union with Christ | The Spirit is the bond that unites believers to Christ — the root of all other blessings |\n| Spirit baptism | One-time, at conversion, for all believers — 1 Cor. 12:13 |\n| Spirit filling | Ongoing, repeatable, commanded — actively sought through obedience and prayer |"
