            "plainText": "| Theme | Core Point |\n|-------|-----------|\n| Trinitarian prayer | To the Father, through the Son, by the Spirit — the full Trinitarian structure of Christian prayer |\n| Love and community | God is eternally love within the Trinity; human community reflects and participates in this |\n| Philippine context | Kapwa, equality in difference, self-giving rather than self-seeking — all grounded Trinitarianly |\n| Corporate worship | Genuinely Trinitarian worship addresses Father, mediates through Son, depends on the Spirit |\n| Mission | The Gospel is a Trinitarian story — told rightly only with all three persons in view |\n| Eternal joy | The Trinitarian life is not just doctrine but the eternal joy into which we are being drawn |"
